  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "透き通った　かがやきの　チャーム。持たせると　相手の　技や　特性で能力を　下げられない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "투명하고 빛나는 참. 지니게 하면 상대의 기술이나 특성으로 능력이 떨어지지 않는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "澄澈晶瑩的墜飾。攜帶後，不會因對手的招式或特性而被降低能力。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Objet à tenir. Un talisman translucide et brillant qui empêche les stats du Pokémon de baisser à cause du talent ou d’une capacité de l’adversaire.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gibt man dieses glänzende Item einem Pokémon zum Tragen, können dessen Statuswerte nicht durch Attacken oder Fähigkeiten anderer Pokémon gesenkt werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un amuleto brillante y transparente. Impide que los movimientos o habilidades de otros Pokémon reduzcan las características del Pokémon que lo lleva.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon. Ciondolo brillante e trasparente che impedisce la diminuzione delle statistiche causata da abilità o mosse di altri Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This clear, sparkling amulet protects the holder from having its stats lowered by moves used against it or by other Pokémon’s Abilities.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "透き通った　かがやきの　チャーム。持たせると　相手の　技や　特性で能力を　下げられない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "光芒晶莹剔透的坠饰。携带后，不会因为对手的招式或特性而被降低能力。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
